"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible from 4.1.stable to 4.7.dev1 (and beyond)\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev1 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7260) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700H (20 threads) - 15.79 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you paste a copy of a CSGPolygon3D the gizmos related to editing its shape won't disappear even when deselected.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/75af69d2-64b3-4344-af82-88a7aa55afe3\n\n\nThese gizmos will also still be affected by the original CSGPolygon3D. The effects are only visual as clicking the copy will reset them to their correct state\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/955141cb-f067-4fa6-a774-c59a6b37c29d\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a04275dd-dc91-4895-8d0e-b8031dcd2ce6\n\nReloading the scene fixes this issue.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a copy of a CSGPolygon3D\n- Deselect and check if icons disappear\n- Edit the shape of the original CSGPolygon3D\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[csgpolygonbug - mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25665177/csgpolygonbug.-.mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","or